  {
    "page_content": "Value\nNote: Figures are illustrative and demonstrate the mechanics of Weighted Factor application; actual Weighted\nFactors are published annually by the Pricing Committee.\n7. Approval Requirements\nAllocations resulting in variance greater than 10% from Relative SSP require Regional Finance Head sign-off prior to\nbooking.\nCONTROL ENHANCEMENT\nThreshold reduced from 20% to 10%; approval authority elevated from Finance Manager to Regional Finance\nHead.\n8. Related Policies\n- POL-ORD-001: Order Intake Recognition & Measurement Policy\n- POL-ORD-003: Order Intake Approval & Backlog Management Policy\n9. Revision History",
